# Editor backups
*~
*.bak
*.tmp

# Test/scratch output. The golden exception matters: without it, freshly
# minted goldens under test/golden/ are silently ignored, `git status` stays
# clean, and CI fails on the missing files under KHEPRI_REQUIRE_GOLDEN --
# which is exactly what happened to 28 of the 53 goldens before 2026-08-04.
*.svg
*.png
*.pdf
*.tex
!assets/**
!test/golden/**
